title = SNCF Class X73500
description = The A-TER is a single unit railcar powered by two MAN engines and have a top speed of 140 kilometres per hour (87 mph).The x73500s are used on rural, unelectrified railway lines in France and are operated by all TER regions except Île-de-France, Corsica and Provence-Alpes-Côte d'Azur.
